{"counts":{"canonical":2,"context":0,"total":2,"unknown_date":0,"unlinked":0},"events":[{"aliases":["Archaeological Site of Mehrgarh","泥砖","聚落"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-bf2f7311a77f802426eb3684","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-bf2f7311a77f802426eb3684","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-5772d60dd6f8b81bb35ec734","summary":"梅赫尔格尔位于今巴基斯坦俾路支省的卡奇平原，靠近博兰山口和博兰河。这里保存了跨公元前第七至第三千纪的长期考古序列，地层深逾十一米。多代居民反复营建泥砖建筑，旧屋遗存被新建筑覆盖，逐渐累积成今天看到的聚落土丘。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前第七至第三千纪","end_year":-2001,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-7000},"title":"梅赫尔格尔群体连续营建泥砖聚落"},{"aliases":["来源未给独立事件专名；据所列遗址、器物或行动描述拟题。","音乐","骨器"],"body":[],"categories":["艺术","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-d11d41a96927b4f4b4dbec85","images":[],"map_reference":{"checked_at":"2026-10-25","kind":"city_reference","label":"贾湖","latitude":33.614398,"license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/","longitude":113.661403,"note":"本条所引原文明确涉及贾湖；地图采用资料支持的地点范围，不表示精确场址或完整路线。 地理补录不代表整条史实已经终审。","precision":"town","role":"材料涉及地点","source_title":"Wikidata Q1688860 · P625","source_url":"https://www.wikidata.org/w/index.php?title=Q1688860&oldid=2545001519"},"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-d11d41a96927b4f4b4dbec85","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-baa2d29a04dc2067ba5cac7e","summary":"贾湖遗址位于河南舞阳，研究将其居住阶段置于约公元前7000至前5700年。发掘所得骨笛用丹顶鹤尺骨制成，既有完整器，也有数量更多的残片。研究介绍的完整笛具有五、六、七或八个音孔，显示制作者能够把天然骨管加工成可产生多个音高的吹奏器。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前7000—前5700年","end_year":-5700,"kind":"duration","precision":"year